You are working on MISE, an AI-native e-commerce store for Japanese kitchen tools.

Tech stack: Next.js 16 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Zustand, Anthropic Claude API
Design: eggshell white with warm gray gradients, single-page "river" metaphor
Data: hardcoded JSON product catalog (32 items), Medusa planned for v2
AI: deterministic discovery engine + opt-in Tier-1 LLM (DeepSeek / Claude Haiku / OpenAI), live-only

Key principles:
- Fluid e-commerce: inspiration-first, conversation-native
- Products emerge from dialogue, not catalog browsing
- High emotional stakes, non-obvious selection, technique pairing
- Prototype-first: defer infrastructure complexity

File conventions: kebab-case for files, PascalCase for components
State: Zustand stores in /store, never prop-drill through more than 2 levels
Types: strict TypeScript, no any